ed bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">vSpeed</code> varying used in fragment rot ✓.</p><p>Now, one bug in <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">buildTreeFromPoints</code> — I need to DELETE that function (dead, and it calls buildTree with degenerate indices which would sampleSurface with garbage). Let me remove it.</p><p>Also — <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">buildTreeFromPointsSampled</code> duplicates the tree points material logic (buildTreePointsFromArrays). Fine.</p><p>Also — check <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">parseOBJ</code> handles negative indices (f -1/-2/-3)? tree.obj from three.js examples uses positive indices ✓ (checked head: "f v/vt/vn" likely). OK.</p><p>Let me clean the dead function now with edit_file. Then write archery.js.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Ek dead function remove karta hoon (fallback path alag hai):</p></div><div data-state="closed" class="not-prose"><button type="button" aria-controls="radix-_r_dl_" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" class="text-text-secondary hover:text-text-tertiary group flex w-full items-center gap-1.5 text-sm transition-colors"><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 group-hover:hidden"><path d="M7 14C5.34315 14 4 15.3431 4 17C4 18.6569 5.34315 20 7 20C7.35064 20 7.68722 19.9398 8 19.8293" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M4.26392 15.6046C2.9243 14.9582 2.00004 13.587 2.00004 12C2.00004 10.7883 2.53877 9.70251 3.38978 8.96898" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="ro