   BLOSSOM — the divine wish tree (WebGL), chapter 3 of scene ii

   Ported from “Blossom Animation 2026” and rebuilt:
     • the project’s own vendored three.module.min.js (r160)
     • transparent renderer — the site’s night sky IS the sky
     • tree.obj vendored locally, procedural fallback if missing
     • OrbitControls → a scroll-driven orbit + pointer parallax
     • the canopy is now real FOLIAGE: thousands of soft golden
       leaves clustered around the branch tips (custom shader,
       sway + twinkle), over a warm ghost silhouette
     • the petal swarm is deliberately sparse and slow
     • god-rays and a halo give the tree its divine light
     • the “2026” effect is kept, in gold

