 --shiki-dark: #E1E4E8;">}</span></span><span class="block before:content-[counter(line)] before:inline-block before:[counter-increment:line] before:w-4 before:mr-4 before:text-[13px] before:text-right before:text-muted-foreground/50 before:font-mono before:select-none"></span></code></pre></div><p>positions: radius rand 3.5-9.5 (around tree), y rand 4-14, but avoid inside trunk center: r &gt;= 3.5 ✓.</p><p>Attributes: aPhase, aSpeed (0.4-1.0), aSize (1.5-3.5).</p><p>uOn tied to rayMats (comes on with rays) ✓.</p><p>Now — the glow layer: uGold=0.9, alpha 0.10→0.12, sizes 1.6-2.8 → keep ~1.4-2.4.</p><p>And canopy layer uGold=0.22 alpha 0.96.</p><p>Trunk gradient numbers: base vec3(0.045,0.022,0.032) top vec3(0.155,0.075,0.085) — dark plum-brown. Rim alpha 0.16.</p><p>Let me make all the edits.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="prose prose-pre:bg-transparent prose-pre:p-0 text-wrap break-words prose-base body-base"><p>Samajh gaya bhai — do problems: (1) <strong>ped "local" lag raha hai</strong> — trunk barely visible ghost hai + speckle dots se tree ka roop hi nahi banta, (2) <strong>flower chapter mein pehle kuch dikhta hi nahi</strong> — bas ek patli stem dheerehti ugti hai. Dono fix karta hoon.</p><p><strong>Pehle flower chapter ka redesign</strong> — 3 flowers ka garden + grass, pehle hi moment se visible:</p></div><div><div class="body-sm flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Expand"><span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 truncate"><span class="text-text-secondary">Write</span><span class="bg-surface-tertiary text-text-tertiary truncate rounded-sm px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-[10px] leading-tight">dipin-birthday-world-v17/js/flower.js</span><span class="text-text-tertiary text-[10px]">265 lines</span></span><button type="button" class="text-text-tertiary hover:text-text-secondary shrink-0 p-0.5 text-[10px]" aria-label="Open file">open</button><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-tertiary ml-auto size-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-pressed="false" class="group/artifact relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-lg border text-left transition duration-150 bg-surface-secondary border-border-faint shadow-[0px_0px_8px_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:border-border-medium hover:bg-surface-tertiary hover:shadow-none focus-visible:ring-interactive-active focus-visible:ring-offset-surface-primary cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-2"><svg width="16" height="16" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="shrink-0 text-text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13.5 6L10 18.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M6.5 8.5L3 12L6.5 15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M17.5 8.5L21 12L17.5 15.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-sm font-normal text-text-primary">flower.js</span><span class="bg-surface-secondary text-text-tertiary shrink-0 rounded-[4px] border px-1.5 py-1 text-xs font-medium uppercase leading-none border-border-medium">JS</span></div><div class="border-border-faint relative mx-3 mb-3 overflow-hidden rounded-[4px] border"><div class="pointer-events-none"><div class="bg-surface-primary h-[260px] w-full overflow-hidden p-3 text-text-secondary whitespace-pre-wrap font-mono text-xs">/* =============================================================
   THE GARDEN — chapter 1 of scene ii

   Three flowers grow and open on the night — a big one in the
   centre and two smaller companions — with grass swaying along
   the ground and warm lights drifting up. The centre flower is
   visible almost immediately (a bud forms early and opens), so
   the chapter never starts on an empty screen.

   Scroll-scrubbed via setProgress(0..1); a quiet rAF adds the
   living motion (sway, flicker, drifting lights) while visible.
   ============================================================ */
(function (w) {
  const reduce = matchMedia("(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)").matches;

  let canvas = null, ctx = null;
  let W = 0, H = 0, dpr = 1;
  let progress = 0, time = 0, lastT = 0, active = false;
  const M = { mounted: false };

  const clamp01 = v =&gt; Math.max(0, Math.min(1, v));
  const smooth = t =&gt; t * t * (3 - 2 * t);
  const sstep = (a, b, t) =&gt; smooth(clamp01((t - a) / (b - a)));
  const lerp = (a, b, t) =&gt; a + (b - a) * t;
  const rand = (a, b) =&gt; a + Math.random() * (b - a);

  /* the three blooms: the big one first, companions join later */
  const FLOWERS = [
    { ox: 0.00, oy: 0.00, s: 1.00, start: 0.00, nO: 8, nI: 6, tilt: 0 },
    { ox: -0.27, oy: 0.085, s: 0.60, start: 0.20, nO: 7, nI: 5, tilt: -0.10 },
    { ox: 0.25, oy: 0.125, s: 0.48, start: 0.34, nO: 6, nI: 4, tilt: 0.12 }
  ];
  /* stable per-flower randomness */
  FLOWERS.forEach(f =&gt; {
    f.petalsO = Array.from({ length: f.nO }, (_, i) =&gt; ({
      ang: (i / f.nO) * Math.PI * 2 + rand(-0.08, 0.08),
      len: rand(0.92, 1.08), wid: rand(0.80, 0.96), d: i * 0.02
    }));
    f.petalsI = Array.from({ length: f.nI }, (_, i) =&gt; ({
      ang: (i / f.nI) * Math.PI * 2 + 0.4 + rand(-0.08, 0.08),
      len: rand(0.52, 0.64), wid: rand(0.72, 0.88), d: i * 0.018
    }));
    f.ph = rand(0, 6.28);
  });

  const GRASS = Array.from({ length: 18 }, (_, i) =&gt; ({
    x: (i + 0.5) / 18 + rand(-0.02, 0.02),
    h: rand(0.05, 0.115), lean: rand(-0.35, 0.35),
    ph: rand(0, 6.28), w: rand(0.5, 1)
  }));
  const LIGHTS = Array.from({ length: 11 }, () =&gt; ({
    ox: rand(-0.42, 0.42), oy: rand(-0.16, 0.1),
    sp: rand(0.16, 0.38), ph: rand(0, 6.28), sz: rand(1.3, 2.6)
  }));

  function resize() {
    if (!canvas) return;
    dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);
    W = canvas.clientWidth || 1; H = canvas.clientHeight || 1;
    canvas.width = Math.round(W * dpr); canvas.height = Math.round(H * dpr);
    ctx.setTransform(dpr, 0, 0, dpr, 0, 0);
    if (!active) draw(progress, 1);
  }

  /* one flower: stem → bud → open petals → golden core */
  function drawFlower(f, p, t) {
    const lp = clamp01((p - f.start) / (0.66 - f.start));
    if (lp &lt;= 0.001) return;

    const R = Math.max(46, Math.min(W, H) * 0.135) * f.s;
    const bx = W * (0.5 + f.ox), by = H * 0.94;
    const sway = reduce ? 0 : Math.sin(t * 0.7 + f.ph) * R * 0.05;
    const hx = bx + f.tilt * R * 2.4 + sway, hy = H * (0.40 + f.oy);

    /* stem (quick — it should be up early) */
    const grow = sstep(0, 0.26, lp);
    if (grow &gt; 0.001) {
      const segs = 22, upto = Math.max(1, Math.round(segs * grow));
      ctx.save();
      ctx.lineCap = "round";
      for (let i = 0; i &lt; upto; i++) {
        const s0 = i / segs, s1 = (i + 1) / segs;
        const a = { x: lerp(bx, hx, s0), y: lerp(by, hy, s0 * s0) };
        const b = { x: lerp(bx, hx, s1), y: lerp(by, hy, s1 * s1) };
        const tt = s0;
        ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(${Math.round(lerp(128, 176, tt))},${Math.round(lerp(94, 130, tt))},${Math.round(lerp(64, 92, tt))},0.92)`;
        ctx.lineWidth = Math.max(1.2, lerp(R * 0.06, R * 0.02, tt));
        ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(a.x, a.y); ctx.lineTo(b.x, b.y); ctx.stroke();
      }
      ctx.restore();
      /* two small leaves on the stem */
      [[0.3, -1], [0.55, 1]].forEach(([s, side]) =&gt; {
        const lg = sstep(0.14, 0.3, lp);
        if (lg &lt;= 0.001) return;
        const at = { x: lerp(bx, hx, s), y: lerp(by, hy, s * s) };
        const L = R * 0.5 * lg, Wd = R * 0.15 * lg;
        ctx.save();
        ctx.translate(at.x, at.y);
        ctx.rotate(side &lt; 0 ? Math.PI * 0.86 : Math.PI * 0.14);
        const g = ctx.createLinearGradient(0, 0, L, 0);
        g.addColorStop(0, "#a97e4f"); g.addColorStop(1, "#d9b278");
        ctx.fillStyle = g;
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.moveTo(0, 0);
        ctx.bezierCurveTo(L * 0.3, -Wd, L * 0.75, -Wd * 0.8, L, 0);
        ctx.bezierCurveTo(L * 0.75, Wd * 0.8, L * 0.3, Wd, 0, 0);
        ctx.fill();
        ctx.restore();
      });
    }

    /* the bud — visible early, before any petal opens */
    const bud = sstep(0.10, 0.24, lp);
    const open = sstep(0.22, 0.58, lp);
    const halo = sstep(0.2, 0.6, lp);

    if (halo &gt; 0.01) {
