e-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M19.7361 15.6046C21.0757 14.9582 22 13.587 22 12C22 10.7883 21.4612 9.70251 20.6102 8.96898" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M20.5795 8.8882C20.8451 8.49109 21 8.01363 21 7.5C21 6.11929 19.8807 5 18.5 5C17.9371 5 17.4176 5.18604 16.9998 5.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M12 4.5C12 3.11929 13.1193 2 14.5 2C15.8807 2 17 3.11929 17 4.5C17 4.88103 16.9148 5.24215 16.7623 5.56533" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M16 20C16 21.1046 15.1046 22 14 22C12.8954 22 12 21.1046 12 20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><svg width="1.5em" height="1.5em" stroke-width="1.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" color="currentColor" class="text-text-secondary hidden h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 group-hover:block"><path d="M9 6L15 12L9 18" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg><p class="leading-[normal]">Thought for 15 seconds</p></button><div class="text-text-secondary text-sm" style="overflow: clip; height: 0px; opacity: 0; filter: blur(2px);"><div style="overflow: auto;"><div class="relative pl-6 pr-2 pt-4" style="will-change: transform;"><div class="bg-sidebar-border absolute bottom-0 left-[6px] top-4 w-0.5 rounded-full"></div><div class="space-y-4 whitespace-normal size-full [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed"><p>Wait — there's an issue with my loader rewrite: the house stage polls <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">window.__house !== undefined</code> — but boot-house.js sets <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-sm" data-streamdown="inline-code">window.__house = mountHouse()</code> which could be null (no-web